Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:55:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST: count joint-war and sanction proposals
 (c7c_proposals)

Running counts per proposer, with a variant for proposals against the bully
test's aggressor: CoopWarAsked, CoopWarAgreed (AI or human asked, the other
side agreed now or after preparing), SanctionsProposed, SanctionsPassed
(World Congress embargo on a player). Measurement only; the AI is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj1hm6um5X9SZaXQCRZ
